{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-1234567890ab",
    "name": "WPMS — Notifications",
    "description": "HTTP API for the Notifications module (`/v1/notifications`).\n\nDB save only — push delivery is not wired yet (`pushedAt` stays null).\n\nImplemented operations:\n- **Create** — `POST /v1/notifications`\n- **List** — `GET /v1/notifications?userId=`\n- **Mark one read** — `PATCH /v1/notifications/:id/read?userId=`\n- **Mark all read** — `PATCH /v1/notifications/read-all?userId=`\n\nResponses are wrapped as `{ success, data, timestamp }`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "bookingId", "value": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "pay_demo_001" },
    { "key": "complaintId", "value": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create by type",
      "description": "One request per `NotificationType` with valid required `data`. Create saves `notificationId` for mark-read requests.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Successful Registration",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 or 201', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('created SUCCESSFUL_REGISTRATION', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.type).to.eql('SUCCESSFUL_REGISTRATION');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.isRead).to.eql(false);",
                  "});",
                  "if (body?.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('notificationId', body.data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"type\": \"SUCCESSFUL_REGISTRATION\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"userName\": \"Nethushi\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/notifications",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "notifications"]
            },
            "description": "Required data: `userName`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
